After resolving an architectural gap, the architect sends a resolution report to the Orchestrator. The message content specifies the outcome, for example:
- { resolution: 'ModelUpdated', details: 'Approved new dependency moment.js' }
- { resolution: 'ReworkRequired', task_id: 'T-105-Refactor' }
This allows the Orchestrator to decide whether to re-audit directly or delegate a new coding task.
